        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                "word": "immortalité",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "795bfe7b-d588-420f-b570-8fff4cc192ec",
                        "entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "immortalités"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c584283d-acb4-3627-bce7-c723852f7c1b",
                        "entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qualité, état de ce qui est immortel ; de ce qui n'est pas soumis à la mort"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "53efd5b1-0ef7-4915-9b7a-3d22a3da564c",
                                "sense_id": "c584283d-acb4-3627-bce7-c723852f7c1b",
                                "text": "Le livre de M. Charles Baudelaire intitulé Les Fleurs du Mal est un défi jeté aux lois qui protègent la religion et la morale. […] À côté de ces pièces et de quelques autres où l’immortalité de l’âme les plus chères croyances du christianisme sont mises à néant, il en est d’autres qui sont l’expression de la lubricité la plus révoltante."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f75af0c0-76b8-4cb9-a1d1-f68c152924e7",
                                "sense_id": "c584283d-acb4-3627-bce7-c723852f7c1b",
                                "text": "S’il y a au monde un fait certain, ferme et durable, c’est la croyance de l’homme en son immortalité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "709a134a-8203-42d9-8c8f-27978b917b0f",
                                "sense_id": "c584283d-acb4-3627-bce7-c723852f7c1b",
                                "text": "Il ne s'agit pas d'escamoter la mort par un rêve d'immortalité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9068a7c8-4f8a-4a3b-88e2-9235ecf09532",
                                "sense_id": "c584283d-acb4-3627-bce7-c723852f7c1b",
                                "text": "J'avais seize ans et des poussières. Je connaissais depuis deux ans l’immense pouvoir de l’immortalité des amants."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5ddc0258-e19d-3b58-a2b5-2fe2e684fab4",
                        "entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Prolongation sans fin du souvenir d’un homme, d’une œuvre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "581f9c7d-bfe4-485d-b207-305f583bd00e",
                                "sense_id": "5ddc0258-e19d-3b58-a2b5-2fe2e684fab4",
                                "text": "Un auteur qui travaille pour l’immortalité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57c4d168-e4b2-4832-8068-ea3fb89b52b1",
                                "sense_id": "5ddc0258-e19d-3b58-a2b5-2fe2e684fab4",
                                "text": "Des actions dignes de l’immortalité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8abe00bd-9ed6-4e55-a9df-237b567e365c",
                                "sense_id": "5ddc0258-e19d-3b58-a2b5-2fe2e684fab4",
                                "text": "Les grands poètes méritent l’immortalité."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1eb9e8b-5fac-4b2d-b98c-32ac2b4ebf4b",
                                "sense_id": "5ddc0258-e19d-3b58-a2b5-2fe2e684fab4",
                                "text": "Aspirer à l’immortalité."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8b14f60f-b5b5-349f-8a48-27d0ffce216d",
                        "entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Nom donné au bûcher enflammé qui sert de nid au phénix."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "856ec543-4730-4cc8-a3b4-40f839a5ff3d",
                                "sense_id": "8b14f60f-b5b5-349f-8a48-27d0ffce216d",
                                "text": "D’azur au phénix d’or sur son immortalité de gueules, accompagné en chef de trois besants d’or, qui est de Drouville → voir illustration « phénix avec immortalité de gueules »"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "25fbc8f9-63de-4e7b-98c6-3564a378712d",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                        "target_lang_word": "Unsterblichkeit",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Unsterblichkeit",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e3aeae1-3854-3cd8-a0ad-e18c2a42cf1f",
                                        "entry_id": "6e937782-bbfb-387b-9619-8f380ad99c78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Eigenschaft, nicht sterben zu können oder zu müssen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1baa47dd-16cf-4ebf-b081-869ffe4db0e2",
                                                "sense_id": "4e3aeae1-3854-3cd8-a0ad-e18c2a42cf1f",
                                                "text": "Wenn man in diesem Computerspiel einen leuchtenden Stern berührt, erlangt man für kurze Zeit Unsterblichkeit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fbbb401-d4e2-4a63-a241-19ac0e8a8c6e",
                                                "sense_id": "4e3aeae1-3854-3cd8-a0ad-e18c2a42cf1f",
                                                "text": "Unsterblichkeit ist Thema vieler Science Fiction Romane."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9da8813f-a272-3eec-92c4-69e02a802734",
                                        "entry_id": "6e937782-bbfb-387b-9619-8f380ad99c78",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Zustand, stets bekannt zu bleiben / nicht vergessen zu werden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "im übertragenen Sinne"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b81374c5-9690-401f-baad-8cd076af97c4",
                                                "sense_id": "9da8813f-a272-3eec-92c4-69e02a802734",
                                                "text": "Mit dieser Geste der Verbundenheit, erlangte er in diesem Kulturkreis Unsterblichkeit."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0fecaf05-3adf-464c-92d8-e154a2255083",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
                        "target_lang_word": "immortality",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "immortality",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "adf005a0-f349-3b30-b16d-09576b4f44ef",
                                        "entry_id": "14486ee1-3cd5-39ad-af2a-242c630e11d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being immortal.",
                                            "Never dying"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d63f974-ca8c-43f1-a412-b6fd6c2f4b9d",
                                                "sense_id": "adf005a0-f349-3b30-b16d-09576b4f44ef",
                                                "text": "In Greek mythology, Tithonus was granted immortality but not eternal youth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "586ba5a6-d64e-404c-ba79-cf1f1c0c34d0",
                                                "sense_id": "adf005a0-f349-3b30-b16d-09576b4f44ef",
                                                "text": "In the little, as in the great things of life, are to be found the type and sign of our immortality. Every hope that looks forward is pledge of the hereafter to which it refers. Who rests content with the present? None. We have all deep within us a craving for the future."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "424e85d0-e44e-40c4-b4e5-51f4db02780d",
                                                "sense_id": "adf005a0-f349-3b30-b16d-09576b4f44ef",
                                                "text": "His one desire was to become the father of a man like himself, and it held him with a grip he only partially understood, for it was the first great desire, the first great passion of his life. Falling in love was a mere physical triviality, like warm sun or cool water, beside this divine hope of immortality: \"I continue.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b4703a6-1c44-3620-9513-5be1399a86f1",
                                        "entry_id": "14486ee1-3cd5-39ad-af2a-242c630e11d4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being immortal.",
                                            "Being remembered forever"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e6dcbf3-f2a5-4974-b6c6-f9e08aeec9e6",
                                                "sense_id": "9b4703a6-1c44-3620-9513-5be1399a86f1",
                                                "text": "You have to salute Gerrard's bravery in accepting the challenge of trying to turn Rangers around given that he has zero experience in senior management. Immortality beckons if he does it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e5bf6320-ad17-48d8-b18a-ba7ba2e2daa0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b27c529-c725-3125-9ded-79586dbac4fe",
